From: pm-official-id <pm-official-id@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 23:15:06 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Player design style, after ArchiveTune's setting of the same
 name
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

ArchiveTune (rukamori/ArchiveTune) keeps a persisted PlayerDesignStyle
enum picked in Appearance → Player; Lokal now has the same: Lokal (the
modern player), Classic (the unwired ClassicFullPlayerScreen, finally
reached), and Immersive (edge-to-edge artwork, absorbing the old
Fullscreen cover toggle — the preference migrates on load).

Every path that opens Now Playing (tap, pull-up, mini-player long-press)
routes by the style. The picker lives in Appearance → Now Playing.
Verified on an emulator: Classic selected, the classic layout opens.
